18 Fuß und darüber.</p>   <p rendition="#indent-1">50. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Balaena</hi>. Dentes nulli. Laminae loco su-<lb/>
periorum corneae</hi>.</p>   <p rendition="#indent-2">1. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Mysticetus</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">der Wallfisch</hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">la baleine</hi></hi>.<lb/>
