<p rendition="#indent-2">7. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Mollissima</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">der Eidervogel</hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">l'oye à<lb/>
duvet</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">Engl</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">the eiderduck, cuthbert duck</hi></hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">A.<lb/>
