<p rendition="#indent-1">79. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Alca</hi></hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Engl</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">auk</hi></hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">Rostrum edentulum,<lb/>
