Zehen (<hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">pinnati</hi></hi>) haben.</p>   <p rendition="#indent-1">1. <hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Testudo</hi><note anchored="true" place="foot" n="*)"><p><hi rendition="#g">Brogniart's</hi> <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Cheloniens</hi></hi>.</p></note>.</hi> <hi rendition="#g">Schildkröte</hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">tortue</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">Engl</hi>.<lb/>
