biae anticae saepius dentatae</hi>.</p>   <p rendition="#indent-2">1. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Hercules</hi></hi>. (<hi rendition="#aq">Geotrupes <hi rendition="#i">Hercules</hi>. F.</hi>) <hi rendition="#aq">S. scu-<lb/>
