Der Käfer variirt in der Farbe, schmutzig-grün &#xA75B;c.</p>   <p rendition="#indent-2">2. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Actaeon</hi></hi>. (<hi rendition="#aq">Geotrupes <hi rendition="#i">A</hi>. F.</hi>) <hi rendition="#aq">S. scutellatus tho-<lb/>
race bicorni, capitis cornu unidentato, apice bifido.</hi></p>
