<p rendition="#l2em"><hi rendition="#g">Rösel</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">vol</hi>. II. Erdkäf. I. <hi rendition="#aq">tab.</hi> A. <hi rendition="#aq">fig</hi>. 2.</p>   <p rendition="#l1em">Hat gleiches Vaterland mit dem vorigen.</p>   <p rendition="#indent-2">3. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Lunaris</hi></hi>. (<hi rendition="#aq">Copris <hi rendition="#i">L</hi>. F.</hi>) <hi rendition="#aq">S. exscutellatus,<lb/>
