<p rendition="#indent-2">7. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Stercorarius</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">der Roßkäfer</hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Engl</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">the<lb/>
