<pb facs="#f0305" xml:id="pb283_0001" n="283"/>
<p rendition="#indent-2">5. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Bacchus</hi></hi>. (<hi rendition="#aq">Attelabus <hi rendition="#i">B.</hi> F.</hi>) <hi rendition="#g">der Reben-<lb/>
