femoribus dentatis, corpore griseo longitudine rostri</hi>.</p>   <p rendition="#l2em"><hi rendition="#g">Rösel</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">vol</hi>. III. Erdkäf. IV. <hi rendition="#aq">tab.</hi> 67.</p>   <p rendition="#l1em">Macht die Haselnüsse wurmstichig.</p>   <p rendition="#indent-2">8. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Imperialis</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">der Juwelenkäfer</hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Engl</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">the<lb/>
