<pb facs="#f0344" xml:id="pb322_0001" n="322"/>
<p rendition="#indent-2">2. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Striata</hi>. P. nigra, alis testaceis, nervoso-<lb/>
