<hi rendition="#aq">Os dentibus</hi> 2: <hi rendition="#aq">palpis</hi> 4. <hi rendition="#aq">Ocelli nulli. Alae<lb/>
deflexae</hi> (<hi rendition="#aq">nec plicatae</hi>). <hi rendition="#aq">Antennae thorace<lb/>
