<p rendition="#indent-2">1. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Formicarius</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">der Ameisenlöwe</hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">le<lb/>
