pier überzogenen Pappe.</p>   <p rendition="#indent-1">60. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Apis</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">Biene</hi>. (Fr. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">abeille</hi></hi>. Engl. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">bee</hi></hi>.)<lb/>
