widerlegt. Reisen II. Theil. S. 231.</p></note>.</p>   <p rendition="#indent-2">1. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Afer</hi>. S. pectinibus</hi> 13-<hi rendition="#aq">dentatis, manibus sub-<lb/>
