Trocknen zu leben bestimmt ist.</p>   <p rendition="#indent-1">65. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Echinus</hi></hi><note anchored="true" place="foot" n="*)"><p><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Jac. Theod. Kleinii</hi> <hi rendition="#i">naturalis dispositio echinodermatum<lb/>
