<p rendition="#indent-2">2. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Fluviatilis.</hi></hi> (<hi rendition="#g">Ruß</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Badiäga</hi></hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">S. conformis<lb/>
